Okay, fair enough. It's really CLL 10.25 that I don't understand (which is =
how this came up). It seems like CLL 10.25 is trying to tag a termset, {zu'=
a nu'i la .djordj. la'u lo mitre be li re}. But it's not tagged (jbofi'e no=
twithstanding), and I'm not clear on whether {la .djordj.} would end up in =
the main selbri's place structure.

